  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 301.01 “Direct supervision” means supervision during which the supervisor is physically present and observing the activities of the individual being supervised.\n\nSource. #10686, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14337, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
